<h1>Data Sets</h1>

<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <p>Please Read This First!</p>
  <p>
    <a href="/yellow_box/"> Click for data usage notes </a>
  </p>
</div>
<p>
  The
  <a href="https://dcc.ligo.org/LIGO-M1000066/public" target="_blank">
    LIGO Laboratory's Data Management Plan</a
  >
  describes the scope and timing of LIGO data releases.
</p>

<div class="row striped">
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <h2>Events and Catalogs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/eventapi">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-table-list"></i> Event Portal
    </a>
    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/CommCatalogs/CommCatInfo">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-table-list"></i> Community Catalogs
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="row striped">
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <h2>Large Data Sets</h2>
    <p>
      For users of computing clusters or if accessing large amounts of data,
      OSDF is the preferred method to access public data.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/osdf">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i> OSDF Docs
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row striped">
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <h2>O4a Data Release</h2>
    <p><b>O4a Time Range</b>: May 24, 2023 through January 16, 2024</p>  
	<p><b>Additional data segments (ER15)</b>: May 15, 2023 through May 19, 2024</p>  
    <p><b>Detectors</b>: H1, L1</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/archive/O4a_4KHZ_R1/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> 4 kHz Data
    </a>

    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/archive/O4a_16KHZ_R1/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> 16 kHz Data
    </a>

    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/O4/O4a">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Documents
    </a>

    <a
      type="button"
      class="button button-small"
      href="/timeline/show/O4a_16KHZ_R1/H1_DATA*L1_DATA/1368195220/21260798/"
    >
      <i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> Timeline
    </a>

    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/O4/auxiliary">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i> Auxiliary Data
    </a>

    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/O4/o4_alternate">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i> Alternate Strain
    </a>

  </div>
</div>

<div class="row striped">
