    <h2>GEO Data around FRBs</h2>
    <p><b>Time Range</b>: April 28, 2020 through Dec 2, 2022</p>
    <p><b>Detectors</b>: GEO600 (Select times only)</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-sm-6">
