      <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Documents
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row striped">
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <h2>O3GK Data Release</h2>
    <p><b>O3GK Time Range</b>: April 7, 2020 through April 21, 2020</p>
    <p><b>Detectors</b>: G1 and K1</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <a type="button" class="button button-small" href="/archive/O3GK_4KHZ_R1/">
